 r←Test_02_Read base_url;D;event_type;h;name;res;table
⍝ Test that GET /crud/{table} lists rows and GET /crud/{table}/{id} returns a single row.

 D←#.DCMS

 r←1
 :For name :In 'event_type' 'event' 'organisation' 'person' 'presentation_type' 'presentation' 'presenter' 'presentation_video' 'presentation_media' 'youtube_video'
     h←⎕NEW #.HttpCommand'GET'
     h.URL←base_url,'/crud/',name
     h.TranslateData←1
     'x-api-key'h.SetHeader #.DCMS.GLOBAL.secrets.upload_token
     res←h.Run
     :If 200≢res.HttpStatus
     :OrIf 1≥≢res.Data.data   ⍝ Should return a list of items
         r←0
         :Return
     :EndIf

     h←⎕NEW #.HttpCommand'GET'
     h.URL←base_url,'/crud/',name,'/1'
     h.TranslateData←1
     'x-api-key'h.SetHeader #.DCMS.GLOBAL.secrets.upload_token
     res←h.Run
     :If 200≢res.HttpStatus
     :OrIf 1≠res.Data.id
         r←0
         :Return
     :EndIf
 :EndFor
